<section class="accounting-setup" aria-labelledby="accounting-setup-title">
  <div class="setup-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">Første oppsett</span><h2 id="accounting-setup-title">Gjør virksomheten klar.</h2><p>Velg eller legg til kontoer og opprett regnskapsåret før du begynner å føre. Endringer krever redaktør- eller eierrolle.</p></div><span class="setup-badge">SMB-start</span></div>
  <div class="setup-grid">
    <form id="setup-starter-form" class="setup-starter"><h3>Start med en enkel SMB-kontoplan</h3><p>Legger inn de vanligste kontoene for bank, kunder, leverandører, MVA, salg og kostnader. Eksisterende kontoer røres ikke.</p><button type="submit">Legg inn SMB-grunnoppsett</button><small>Få kontoplan og MVA-oppsett kvalitetssikret av regnskapsfører før innsending.</small></form>
    <form id="setup-import-form" class="setup-import"><h3>Importer åpningsbalanse eller historikk</h3><input name="voucherFile" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" required /><p>CSV: dato;periode;beskrivelse;referanse;konto-ID;linjetekst;debet-kr;kredit-kr;mva-kode. Én linje per postering.</p><a id="setup-import-template" class="setup-template" href="#">Last ned CSV-mal</a><button type="submit">Importer balanserte bilag</button><small>Maks 100 bilag. Ingen automatisk MVA- eller kontogjetting.</small></form>
    <form id="setup-account-form"><h3>Ny konto i kontoplanen</h3><div class="setup-row"><label>Kontonummer<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" required placeholder="4300" /></label><label>Navn<input name="name" maxlength="160" required placeholder="Kontorrekvisita" /></label></div><div class="setup-row"><label>Kontotype<select name="accountType"><option value="expense">Kostnad</option><option value="asset">Eiendel</option><option value="liability">Gjeld</option><option value="equity">Egenkapital</option><option value="revenue">Inntekt</option></select></label><label>MVA-kode<input name="vatCode" maxlength="20" placeholder="3 (valgfritt)" /></label></div><button type="submit">Legg til konto</button></form>
    <form id="setup-period-form"><h3>Nytt regnskapsår eller periode</h3><label><span id="setup-period-label">Regnskapsår</span><input name="year" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" step="1" required /></label><small id="setup-period-help">Åpner alle 12 måneder. Eksisterende perioder beholdes, så du kan trygt kjøre dette på nytt.</small><button id="setup-period-submit" type="submit">Åpne regnskapsår</button><a id="setup-period-month-toggle" href="#">Åpne bare én måned</a></form>
  </div>
  <div class="setup-summary"><div><strong id="setup-account-count">—</strong><span>aktive kontoer</span></div><div><strong id="setup-period-count">—</strong><span>åpne perioder</span></div></div>
  <section class="setup-account-list" aria-labelledby="setup-account-list-title">
    <div class="setup-account-list-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">Kontoplan</span><h3 id="setup-account-list-title">Hold kontoene oppdaterte.</h3><p>Endre navn, MVA-kode eller status når virksomheten endrer seg. En konto som er brukt i bokføring kan ikke deaktiveres eller bytte kontotype.</p></div><span id="setup-account-list-status" class="setup-account-list-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div>
    <div id="setup-account-list" class="setup-account-table"><p class="setup-account-empty">Henter kontoer…</p></div>
    <form id="setup-account-edit" class="setup-account-edit" hidden>
      <input type="hidden" name="accountId" />
      <h4>Rediger konto</h4>
      <div class="setup-row"><label>Kontonummer<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" required /></label><label>Navn<input name="name" maxlength="160" required /></label></div>
      <div class="setup-row"><label>Kontotype<select name="accountType"><option value="expense">Kostnad</option><option value="asset">Eiendel</option><option value="liability">Gjeld</option><option value="equity">Egenkapital</option><option value="revenue">Inntekt</option></select></label><label>MVA-kode<input name="vatCode" maxlength="20" placeholder="3 (valgfritt)" /></label></div>
      <label class="setup-account-active"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked /> Kontoen er aktiv</label>
      <div class="setup-account-edit-actions"><button type="submit">Lagre endringer</button><button type="button" id="setup-account-cancel">Avbryt</button></div>
    </form>
  </section>
  <section class="setup-readiness" aria-labelledby="setup-readiness-title">
    <div class="setup-readiness-head"><div><span class="section-kicker">Klar til å føre?</span><h3 id="setup-readiness-title">Fem ting å sjekke først.</h3><p>Dette er en veiviser, ikke en sperre. Den viser hva som mangler før dere begynner med det daglige regnskapet.</p></div><strong id="setup-readiness-count">Sjekker…</strong></div>
    <ol id="setup-readiness-list" class="setup-readiness-list" aria-live="polite">
      <li data-readiness="chart"><span class="readiness-icon">1</span><div><strong>Kontoplan</strong><small>Legg inn en enkel SMB-kontoplan.</small></div><a href="#setup-starter-form">Åpne</a></li>
      <li data-readiness="period"><span class="readiness-icon">2</span><div><strong>Regnskapsår</strong><small>Ha minst én åpen periode.</small></div><a href="#setup-period-form">Åpne</a></li>
      <li data-readiness="profile"><span class="readiness-icon">3</span><div><strong>Virksomhetsprofil</strong><small>Navn, organisasjonsnummer og adresse til faktura.</small></div><a href="#invoice-setup">Åpne</a></li>
      <li data-readiness="customer"><span class="readiness-icon">4</span><div><strong>Kunderegister</strong><small>Ha minst én kunde med komplett fakturaprofil.</small></div><a href="#invoice-customer-form">Åpne</a></li>
      <li data-readiness="bank"><span class="readiness-icon">5</span><div><strong>Bankkonto</strong><small>Registrer kontoen som skal avstemmes.</small></div><a href="#bank-reconciliation-title">Åpne</a></li>
    </ol>
  </section>
  <p id="setup-status" class="setup-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>
<script is:inline>
  let setupBoard = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('boardId') || ''; let setupAccountIds = {}; let setupAccounts = [];
  const setupStatus = document.querySelector('#setup-status');
  const setupApi = async (url, options) => { const response = await fetch(url, options); const data = await response.json().catch(() => ({})); if (!response.ok) throw new Error(data.error || 'Kunne ikke lagre oppsettet.'); return data; };
  const setupResolve = async () => { if (setupBoard) return; const auth = await (await fetch('/api/auth')).json(); setupBoard = auth.boards?.[0]?.id || ''; };
  const setupRenderAccounts = () => { const list=document.querySelector('#setup-account-list'); if(!list) return; const esc=(value)=>String(value??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c])); const typeLabels={asset:'Eiendel',liability:'Gjeld',equity:'Egenkapital',revenue:'Inntekt',expense:'Kostnad'}; list.innerHTML=setupAccounts.length?setupAccounts.map((account)=>`<article class="setup-account-row ${account.active===0?'inactive':''}"><div><strong>${esc(account.code)} · ${esc(account.name)}</strong><small>${esc(typeLabels[account.account_type]||account.account_type)}${account.vat_code?` · MVA ${esc(account.vat_code)}`:''}${Number(account.voucher_line_count||0)?` · ${esc(account.voucher_line_count)} bokførte linjer`:''}</small></div><span>${account.active===0?'Inaktiv':'Aktiv'}</span><button type="button" class="setup-account-edit-trigger" data-account-id="${esc(account.id)}">Rediger</button></article>`).join(''):'<p class="setup-account-empty">Ingen kontoer er registrert ennå.</p>'; list.querySelectorAll('.setup-account-edit-trigger').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const account=setupAccounts.find((row)=>String(row.id)===button.dataset.accountId);if(!account)return;const form=document.querySelector('#setup-account-edit');form.hidden=false;form.elements.accountId.value=account.id;form.elements.code.value=account.code;form.elements.name.value=account.name;form.elements.accountType.value=account.account_type;form.elements.vatCode.value=account.vat_code||'';form.elements.active.checked=account.active!==0;form.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});})); };
  const setupLoad = async () => { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) return; const [accounts, periods, invoiceSetup, bankAccounts] = await Promise.all([setupApi(`/api/finance?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(setupBoard)}&view=accounts`), setupApi(`/api/finance?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(setupBoard)}&view=periods`), setupApi(`/api/finance?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(setupBoard)}&view=invoice-setup`), setupApi(`/api/bank?boardId=${encodeURIComponent(setupBoard)}&view=accounts`)]); setupAccounts=accounts.data||[]; const activeAccounts=setupAccounts.filter(x => x.active !== 0); const openPeriods=(periods.data || []).filter(x => x.status === 'open'); const seller=invoiceSetup.seller || {}; const customers=invoiceSetup.customers || []; const sellerReady=Boolean(seller.legal_name && seller.org_number && seller.address_line1 && seller.postal_code && seller.city && seller.bank_account); const customerReady=customers.some(customer => customer.address_line1 && customer.postal_code && customer.city && (customer.customer_type === 'private' || customer.org_number)); const readiness={chart:activeAccounts.length >= 5,period:openPeriods.length > 0,profile:sellerReady,customer:customerReady,bank:(bankAccounts.data || []).length > 0}; setupAccountIds = Object.fromEntries(activeAccounts.map(account => [String(account.code), String(account.id)])); document.querySelector('#setup-account-count').textContent = activeAccounts.length; document.querySelector('#setup-period-count').textContent = openPeriods.length; setupRenderAccounts(); const readyCount=Object.values(readiness).filter(Boolean).length; document.querySelector('#setup-readiness-count').textContent = `${readyCount}/5 klart`; const fallbackLabels={chart:'Legg inn en enkel SMB-kontoplan.',period:'Ha minst én åpen periode.',profile:'Navn, organisasjonsnummer, adresse og bankkonto til faktura.',customer:'Opprett minst én kunde med adresse og organisasjonsnummer eller privatkundetype.',bank:'Registrer kontoen som skal avstemmes.'}; const numberLabels={chart:'1',period:'2',profile:'3',customer:'4',bank:'5'}; Object.entries(readiness).forEach(([key,ready]) => { const item=document.querySelector(`[data-readiness="${key}"]`); if(!item)return; item.classList.toggle('ready',ready); item.querySelector('.readiness-icon').textContent=ready?'✓':numberLabels[key]; item.querySelector('small').textContent=ready ? 'Klar for neste steg.' : fallbackLabels[key]; item.querySelector('a').textContent=ready?'Se':'Åpne'; }); };
  const parseSetupRows = (text) => { const rows = []; const firstLine = String(text).split(/\r?\n/, 1)[0] || ''; const delimiter = (firstLine.match(/;/g)||[]).length >= 2 ? ';' : ','; let row = [], field = '', quoted = false; for (let i = 0; i < text.length; i += 1) { const char = text[i]; const next = text[i + 1]; if (char === '"' && quoted && next === '"') { field += '"'; i += 1; continue; } if (char === '"') { quoted = !quoted; continue; } if (!quoted && char === delimiter) { row.push(field); field = ''; continue; } if (!quoted && (char === '\n' || char === '\r')) { if (char === '\r' && next === '\n') i += 1; row.push(field); if (row.some(value => value.trim())) rows.push(row); row = []; field = ''; continue; } field += char; } row.push(field); if (row.some(value => value.trim())) rows.push(row); return rows; };
  const parseSetupCsv = (text) => { const groups = new Map(); const rows = parseSetupRows(text); rows.forEach((raw, index) => { const parts = raw.map(value => String(value || '').trim()); if (index === 0 && /dato|date/i.test(parts[0] || '')) return; const [voucherDate, period, description, externalReference, accountId, lineDescription, debit, credit, vatCode] = parts; const key = externalReference || `${voucherDate}|${description}`; const amount = (value) => { const normalized = String(value || '0').replace(/\s/g, '').replace(/(\d)[.](?=\d{3}(?:\D|$))/g, '$1').replace(',', '.'); const number = Number(normalized); return Number.isFinite(number) ? Math.round(number * 100) : NaN; }; if (!groups.has(key)) groups.set(key, { voucherDate, period: period || voucherDate.slice(0, 7), description, externalReference: externalReference || null, lines: [] }); groups.get(key).lines.push({ accountId, description: lineDescription || description, debitMinor: amount(debit), creditMinor: amount(credit), vatCode: vatCode || null }); }); return [...groups.values()]; };
  document.querySelector('#setup-import-template')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); const now = new Date(); const isoDate = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10); const period = isoDate.slice(0, 7); const bankId = setupAccountIds['1920'] || 'LIM_INN_KONTO_ID_FOR_1920'; const equityId = setupAccountIds['2050'] || 'LIM_INN_KONTO_ID_FOR_2050'; const csv = ['dato;periode;beskrivelse;referanse;konto-ID;linjetekst;debet-kr;kredit-kr;mva-kode', `${isoDate};${period};Eksempel åpningsbalanse;OB-${period};${bankId};Bank;10000;;`, `${isoDate};${period};Eksempel åpningsbalanse;OB-${period};${equityId};Innskutt egenkapital;;10000;`].join('\n'); const blob = new Blob([`\ufeff${csv}\n`], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8' }); const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob); const link = document.createElement('a'); link.href = url; link.download = `styring-bilagsimport-mal-${period}.csv`; link.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url); });
  document.querySelector('#setup-import-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => { event.preventDefault(); const form = event.currentTarget; const file = new FormData(form).get('voucherFile'); setupStatus.textContent = 'Validerer bilagsimport…'; try { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) throw new Error('Ingen virksomhet er valgt.'); if (!file || !file.text) throw new Error('Velg en CSV-fil først.'); const vouchers = parseSetupCsv(await file.text()); if (!vouchers.length) throw new Error('CSV-filen inneholder ingen bilag.'); const result = await setupApi('/api/finance', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ boardId: setupBoard, action: 'import_vouchers', vouchers }) }); setupStatus.textContent = `✓ ${result.imported} balanserte bilag er importert.`; form.reset(); await setupLoad(); } catch (error) { setupStatus.textContent = `Kunne ikke importere bilag: ${error.message}`; } });
  document.querySelector('#setup-starter-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => { event.preventDefault(); setupStatus.textContent = 'Legger inn SMB-grunnoppsett…'; try { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) throw new Error('Ingen virksomhet er valgt.'); const result = await setupApi('/api/finance', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ boardId: setupBoard, action: 'seed_smb_chart' }) }); setupStatus.textContent = `✓ Kontoplan klar: ${result.inserted} nye kontoer lagt inn (${result.existing} fantes fra før).`; await setupLoad(); } catch (error) { setupStatus.textContent = `Kunne ikke legge inn grunnoppsettet: ${error.message}`; } });
  document.querySelector('#setup-account-form')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => { event.preventDefault(); const form = event.currentTarget; const values = new FormData(form); setupStatus.textContent = 'Lagrer konto…'; try { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) throw new Error('Ingen virksomhet er valgt.'); await setupApi('/api/finance', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ boardId: setupBoard, action: 'create_account', code: values.get('code'), name: values.get('name'), accountType: values.get('accountType'), vatCode: values.get('vatCode') }) }); setupStatus.textContent = '✓ Kontoen er lagt til i kontoplanen.'; form.reset(); await setupLoad(); } catch (error) { setupStatus.textContent = `Kunne ikke legge til konto: ${error.message}`; } });
  document.querySelector('#setup-account-edit')?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => { event.preventDefault(); const form=event.currentTarget; const values=new FormData(form); const status=document.querySelector('#setup-account-list-status'); status.textContent='Lagrer konto…'; try { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) throw new Error('Ingen virksomhet er valgt.'); await setupApi('/api/finance',{method:'POST',headers:{'content-type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({boardId:setupBoard,action:'update_account',accountId:values.get('accountId'),code:values.get('code'),name:values.get('name'),accountType:values.get('accountType'),vatCode:values.get('vatCode'),active:form.elements.active.checked})}); status.textContent='✓ Kontoen er oppdatert.'; form.hidden=true; await setupLoad(); } catch(error) { status.textContent=`Kunne ikke oppdatere konto: ${error.message}`; } });
  document.querySelector('#setup-account-cancel')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const form=document.querySelector('#setup-account-edit');form.hidden=true;});
  const periodForm = document.querySelector('#setup-period-form'); const periodYear = periodForm?.querySelector('[name="year"]'); if (periodYear) periodYear.value = String(new Date().getFullYear());
  document.querySelector('#setup-period-month-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); if (!periodForm || !periodYear) return; const useYear = periodYear.type === 'month'; const label = document.querySelector('#setup-period-label'); const help = document.querySelector('#setup-period-help'); const submit = document.querySelector('#setup-period-submit'); periodYear.type = useYear ? 'number' : 'month'; periodYear.name = useYear ? 'year' : 'period'; periodYear.value = useYear ? String(new Date().getFullYear()) : `${new Date().getFullYear()}-${String(new Date().getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}`; periodYear.min = useYear ? '2000' : ''; periodYear.max = useYear ? '2100' : ''; periodYear.step = useYear ? '1' : ''; label.textContent = useYear ? 'Regnskapsår' : 'Måned'; help.textContent = useYear ? 'Åpner alle 12 måneder. Eksisterende perioder beholdes, så du kan trygt kjøre dette på nytt.' : 'Bruk dette bare når du trenger å legge til én enkelt periode.'; submit.textContent = useYear ? 'Åpne regnskapsår' : 'Åpne periode'; event.currentTarget.textContent = useYear ? 'Åpne bare én måned' : 'Åpne hele regnskapsåret'; });
  periodForm?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => { event.preventDefault(); const form = event.currentTarget; const values = new FormData(form); const isMonth = periodYear?.type === 'month'; const period = isMonth ? String(values.get('period') || '') : ''; const year = isMonth ? '' : String(values.get('year') || ''); setupStatus.textContent = isMonth ? 'Åpner periode…' : 'Åpner regnskapsår…'; try { await setupResolve(); if (!setupBoard) throw new Error('Ingen virksomhet er valgt.'); const result = await setupApi('/api/finance', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(isMonth ? { boardId: setupBoard, action: 'create_period', period } : { boardId: setupBoard, action: 'create_fiscal_year', year }) }); setupStatus.textContent = isMonth ? `✓ Perioden ${period} er åpnet.` : `✓ Regnskapsåret ${result.year} er klart: ${result.created} nye perioder åpnet (${result.existing} fantes fra før).`; form.reset(); if (periodYear) periodYear.value = isMonth ? `${new Date().getFullYear()}-${String(new Date().getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}` : String(new Date().getFullYear()); await setupLoad(); } catch (error) { setupStatus.textContent = `Kunne ikke åpne perioden: ${error.message}`; } });
  setupLoad().catch(() => { setupStatus.textContent = 'Oppsettet krever innlogging med virksomhetstilgang.'; });
  const openInvoiceSetup = (event) => { const toggle=document.querySelector('#invoice-setup-toggle'); const panel=document.querySelector('#invoice-setup'); if(!toggle||!panel)return; event.preventDefault(); if(panel.hidden)toggle.click(); panel.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}); };
  document.querySelector('[data-readiness="profile"] a')?.addEventListener('click', openInvoiceSetup);
  document.querySelector('[data-readiness="customer"] a')?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { const target=document.querySelector('#invoice-customer-form'); if(!target)return; event.preventDefault(); target.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}); });
</script>
<style>
  .accounting-setup{margin:0 0 22px;padding:24px;border:1px solid rgba(16,36,31,.1);border-radius:18px;background:#fffdf3}.setup-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.setup-head h2{margin:8px 0;font:500 1.8rem/1 Georgia,serif}.setup-head p{max-width:700px;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-badge{height:max-content;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#e5f2d7;color:#27643f;font:700 .62rem/1 system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap}.setup-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr .7fr;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}.setup-grid form{display:grid;gap:8px;padding:15px;border:1px solid rgba(16,36,31,.08);border-radius:12px;background:#fff}.setup-grid h3{margin:0;font:700 .8rem/1.2 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font:.68rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.5fr;gap:8px}.setup-grid label{display:grid;gap:4px;color:var(--muted);font:600 .62rem/1.2 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-grid input,.setup-grid select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:8px;border:1px solid rgba(16,36,31,.15);border-radius:7px;background:#fff;font:.72rem system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-grid button{margin-top:auto;padding:9px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--night);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:700 .67rem/1 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-grid small{color:var(--muted);font:.64rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-template,#setup-period-month-toggle{color:var(--accent);font:700 .68rem/1.2 system-ui,sans-serif;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.setup-summary{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}.setup-summary div{padding:10px 13px;border-radius:9px;background:#f3f7f1}.setup-summary strong,.setup-summary span{display:block}.setup-summary strong{font:700 1rem system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-summary span{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted);font:.62rem system-ui,sans-serif}.setup-status{min-height:1.2em;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--accent);font:700 .7rem/1.3 system-ui,sans-serif}@media(max-width:980px){.setup-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:680px){.setup-head{display:block}.setup-badge{display:inline-flex;margin-top:8px}.setup-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.setup-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
